<title>FINLAND: SAMPO H1 OPERATING PROFIT FIM 386 MLN.</title>
<headline>SAMPO H1 OPERATING PROFIT FIM 386 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit			     386 vs 383</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    13.91 vs 10.79</p>
<p> Net asset value per share (markka)     429 vs 419</p>
<p> Earnings premiums			  1,930 vs 1,934</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' mean forecast was for a 325 million markka</p>
<p>first-half operating profit in a 225 million markka to 444</p>
<p>million markka range.</p>
<p> Claims paid					1,797 vs 1,650</p>
<p> Operating expenses				 428 vs 395</p>
<p>BALANCE ON TECHNICAL ACCOUNT BEFORE CHANGE</p>
<p> IN THE EQUALISATION PROVISION	   loss 296 vs 111 loss</p>
<p> Investment income and charges	   gain 697 vs 511 gain</p>
<p> Other income and charges		 charge 28 vs 21 charge</p>
<p> Share of associated company results    gain 13 vs 3 gain</p>
<p> Change in equalisation provision     charge 82 vs 149 charge</p>
<p>Unrealised gains on investments</p>
<p>   and revaluation adjustments		  nil vs nil</p>
<p> PROFIT BEFORE EXTRAORDINARY ITEMS,TAXES    304 vs 233</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 21 gain</p>
<p> PROFIT BEFORE APPROPRIATIONS AND TAXES     304 vs 255</p>
<p> NET PROFIT					   208 vs 185</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish insurer is Vakuutusosakeyhtio</p>
<p>Sampo.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
